  "controlsHelp": "Hold up (or W) for the throttle. Let go and the bike rolls to a stop.\n\nLeft and right (or A and D) steer. Down or S brakes, and Space pauses.\n\nPhones and tablets: the two handlebars move together. Hold the right handlebar (GAS) to ride and let go to brake. Drag either handlebar to turn: right bar down (left bar up) steers right, left bar down (right bar up) steers left. You can also tilt the device like a steering wheel, or switch on Use Screentouch in the race controls menu (top right) to steer with the handlebars only.",
